WEBVTT

00:16:57.756 --> 00:17:02.956
So how about the next meeting you're in,

00:17:02.996 --> 00:17:06.356
when you have something to say,
don't hesitate and speak up.

00:17:07.236 --> 00:17:08.436
L: Done, I'll do it.

00:17:08.436 --> 00:17:09.916
DHP: OK, but here's the thing,

00:17:09.916 --> 00:17:13.116
what I like about this is you've just
made a promise to 300 people.

00:17:13.156 --> 00:17:14.596
So you're on the hook.

00:17:14.636 --> 00:17:15.996
L: I'm on the hook.

00:17:16.036 --> 00:17:17.196
DHP: So this is it.

00:17:17.236 --> 00:17:18.836
So, Lily has this regret.

00:17:18.876 --> 00:17:22.196
She's looking backwards, saying,
"Oh, if only I'd spoken up,"

00:17:22.196 --> 00:17:25.116
and instead of beating herself up,
she is divulging it,

00:17:25.156 --> 00:17:26.876
she's extracting a lesson from it,

00:17:26.876 --> 00:17:29.996
and she's taking that and applying
it to some next interaction.